    care about) -- never mistaken for a real upload; the admin list/edit screens still say "대표 이미지 없음"
    exactly as before (unchanged by this handoff). %>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="flex aspect-video w-full items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 via-blue-50 to-slate-100">
  <span class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-200"><%= product_line.customer_name.first %></span>
</div>
